    "quotes": [
      {
        "speaker": "Reshma Sohoni",
        "quote": "Seedcamp has a long tradition of backing founders who change how we work, from UiPath and Synthesia to Marble today. Most companies want to automate more, but the hard part has always been mapping out how the work gets done. Marble fills that gap, giving companies vital context for AI transformations that could define their future. We’re proud to back them from the start.",
